  "description": "The Cross 300 is a dedicated fitness and commuting machine designed for riders who prioritize speed and efficiency. Unlike basic 21-speed cruisers, this model features a Shimano Altus 24-speed drivetrain. The expanded gear range is engineered for performance; it allows you to maintain a high cadence on long straightaways and stay seated during steep climbs, significantly reducing knee strain compared to lower-tier setups.\nAt just 30 lbs, the lightweight alloy frame is paired with a Zoom 50mm suspension fork to dampen road chatter. The flat-bar geometry provides an athletic, responsive feel, making it perfect for weaving through traffic or hitting fitness goals. To ensure a custom-feel ride, we offer multiple frame sizes to accommodate riders from 5'1\" up to 6'5\". Please refer to our sizing chart below to find your perfect fit.\n🎁 Official Corporate Bonus: The Fitness Starter Pack\nWhen you order directly from our South El Monte headquarters, we include two essential bonuses inside your bike box to kickstart your journey:\n\nPro-Assembly Tool Kit: Located inside the small parts box, you’ll find the specific Allen Key Wrench and Pedal Wrench needed for final assembly. No extra trips to the hardware store—everything you need is right there.\n\nAs an Official Corporate Exclusive, every Cross 300 is inspected by our senior technicians before shipping. By buying direct, you get a performance-tuned machine backed by two decades of the engineering expertise and factory-direct support.\nElevate your ride.",
